  "body": "The vendor is eager to sell this brand-new property quickly!\r\n\r\nThis stunning three-bedroom, three-bathroom home offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and convenience—just a short walk from Long Bay Village and the beautiful Long Bay Beach.\r\n\r\nDesigned for a relaxed coastal lifestyle, this north-facing home is bathed in natural light, featuring open balconies and seamless indoor-outdoor flow. Two of the bedrooms boast private ensuites, while the top-floor master suite offers a peaceful retreat with its own lounge or home office nook, overlooking the serene rural landscape.\r\n\r\nA stylish combination of brick, Colorsteel, and wood cladding gives the home a modern yet timeless appeal.\r\n\r\nWith shops, cafés, and bars just a short stroll away, this low-maintenance, lock-and-leave property is an exceptional opportunity in one of the most sought-after coastal locations.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
